view structure · elevator
marks: ● mutable state (← who changes it) · !n invariant n · ? gap: the description does not say · ∅ declared absence: none, on purpose · ⚠ warning · ⏱ timeout · ⟳ period

structure (level 0 uses the ones below)
level 0:
cli · module !4
  commands compare, run
  → uses dispatch, metrics, timeline, config, execution, report, output
level 1:
config · module !4,6,7
  Config · configuration (immutable)
  8 fields [speed ⚠] [seed ∅]
  limits: capacity ≥1; door_time ≥0; duration ≥0; elevators ≥1; floors ≥2; rate ≥0; speed >0
execution · module
  → uses dispatch, simulator, passengers
metrics · module
  floors traveled · metric
  mean trip · metric
